      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Spellcasts empower Taric's next 2 basic attacks to deal bonus magic damage, reduce his spell cooldowns, and attack in quick succession.",
      "summary_zh": "每次施放技能会强化塔里克的下2次普攻，以造成额外魔法伤害，使他的基础技能的冷却时间减少，并且可以快速地连续攻击。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1309752:3986177"
