      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Heals nearby allied champions based on charges stored. Bravado-empowered attacks grant a charge of Starlight's Touch.",
      "summary_zh": "基于已储存的充能来治疗附近的友方英雄。【正气凌人】的强化普攻会为这个技能提供一层充能。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1309754:3996427"
      ]
