      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Passively increase the Armor of Taric and any allied champion with Bastion. Actively shields an ally and grants them Bastion for as long as they remain near Taric. Taric's spells also cast off the ally with Bastion.",
      "summary_zh": "被动提升塔里克和带有【坚毅壁垒】效果的友方英雄的护甲。 主动施放会为一名友方英雄提供护盾和【坚毅壁垒】效果，只要该英雄呆在塔里克身边，【坚毅壁垒】效果会一直持续。塔里克的技能也会从带有【坚毅壁垒】效果的友方英雄身上施放。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1309756:3989049"
      ]
